---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const schema = [{
  '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'AboutPage',
  url: 'https://www.12acrefilms.com/about', name: 'About Matt Slotemaker',
  mainEntity: {
    '@type': 'Person', name: 'Matt Slotemaker', jobTitle: 'Owner and founder',
    worksFor: { '@id': 'https://www.12acrefilms.com/#business' },
    url: 'https://www.12acrefilms.com/about',
  },
}];
---
<Base
  schema={schema}
  title="About Matt Slotemaker, Spokane Videographer"
  description="Matt Slotemaker is a Spokane, WA videographer and founder of 12 Acre Films, specializing in commercial, documentary, live events, and social media video production."
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap narrow prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>So much more than a story</h1>
      <h3 style="font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:500;color:var(--muted)">My name is Matt Slotemaker. I'm the owner and founder of 12 Acre Films.</h3>
      <p>In 2014 my wife and I were lucky enough to buy a 12 acre property outside the city limits. I had a "regular" job at the time, working as a videographer for a travel company. In 2015 they laid me off and shut down soon after.</p>
      <p>Faced with the option of moving to a larger metro to find another in-house job or stay here and forge my own path, we decided to take a leap of faith and give entrepreneurship a shot.</p>
      <p>The name, 12 Acre Films, was a natural choice. We love where we live and have no plans of leaving, just as there are no plans to work for someone else again. And now with 4 kids and a cat, I can say that we are a happy family with lots to keep us busy.</p>
      <p>That's not to say the path of starting this business was smooth. The struggles and stresses, especially early on, were necessary to forge my skill as a video producer and business owner, navigating new challenges and continuing to adapt to the current state of client needs.</p>
      <p>Today 12 Acre Films produces <a href="/corporate-video-production">commercial video</a>, <a href="/nonprofit-fundraising-video">nonprofit video</a>, <a href="/documentary">documentaries</a>, <a href="/live-events">live streams and live events</a>, <a href="/funeral-live-streaming">funeral live streams</a>, <a href="/podcast-video-recording">podcasts</a>, and <a href="/radio-commercial-production">radio ads</a> for clients across the Inland Northwest. See all <a href="/services">services</a> or the <a href="/work">portfolio</a>.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:32px"><a class="btn" href="/contact">Let's talk</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
